确在这个地方的观念里来看，既然收了银子，就算是卖到村长家了：“二婶婶你可能还不知道，我跟村长说好了，在家里住到娘生完孩子，能照顾她自己跟奶奶后再去那边，这几个月里我会想办法还完大家的银子。”“几个月？就你可以赚够钱还大家银子？你拿什么去赚钱？”李氏不依不饶的逼问，虽然这丫头的性子变了，但是大字不识几个的她，如今又成了人家的童养媳，即便是想去大户人家当丫鬟恐怕都没有人收。“这个就不劳二婶婶操心了，总之我苏小凡说到做到，必定会还大家银子，乡里乡亲的大家不会连几个月都不愿意等的吧？”苏小凡笑着扫了一圈众人。“嗯，倒是不急，但是之前的问题，为何你们有钱了就去买东西了，而不是先还给大家，还请给我们个说法，这样大家也可以安心。”苏小凡抬目看去，说话的是三婆王氏——王银，头发已然全白，背微驼，才六十来岁牙齿几乎都全掉光了，虽然没有对外明说，但是大家都明白那可能是三公打掉的，三公这个人年轻的时候有很严重的暴力倾向，好在现在上了年纪，性子也随和了许多。“我们家为何一有了银子就马上拿来去买东西，在场的你们可能不知道，她们却不可能不知道，所以我先前才说二婶婶跟三婶婶，她们二位贵人多忘事。”“凡儿……”贾氏扯了扯苏小凡的衣袖，想叫她住口，但同时却也清楚，若不给大家一个明确的解释，今日很难让众人散去。“娘，别担心。”苏小凡报以她一个微笑，让她安心，娘为人善良，她们都做到那个地步了，娘却还在想办法顾全她们的名声，她苏小凡可不是一个好说话的主，既然她们不顾全亲人的情分，自己又何须再拿她们当亲人。有的时候，在金钱的面前，那个所谓的亲情根本一文不值，她很清楚这一点。“有话就往明面上说。”孟氏尖着嗓音底气十足的吼了一声，她就不相信自己这个上门讨债的人，别人会说自己不对了，欠债还钱本就是天经地义的事儿。“我家里的情况，想必大家都很清楚，奶奶年事已高，娘亲又临盆在即，家里早就是没米下锅了，近日我被张家退婚，又病倒了，张家捎来了一些银两，除去我抓药看病之外还剩下一些碎银子，奶奶拿去买了一个玉米面什么的。”苏小凡说到这微微停顿了一下，后又继续说到：“昨日二叔三叔他们全家上门讨债不成，就将奶奶昨日买回来的东西全都抢了去，现在屋里可是一样吃的都没有了，这村长家送来的银子也不多，我们肯定得先备点吃食，俗话说，这人是铁饭是钢，一顿不吃都饿得慌，若是我们家人都饿死了，各位又该找谁还债去呢？”三婆听完后，走进了厨房，看了一圈后，走出来，对大家说：“小凡丫头说的没错，这家里的确是什么吃的也没有了。”众人听后，三三两两的低头耳语开来。余小西气愤的指着孟氏说：“这好歹你们也算是亲戚，怎么能将人往这份上逼，你们家又并非是缺那点吃食……”“妹妹，好了。”余小荷出声阻止了她，这苏二夫跟苏三夫的为人都不是很好，村里的人多多少少都是知道的，妹妹年纪尚浅，若是开罪了他们，难免日后会被他们欺负。“这是怎么了？到成了我这个借人钱的不对了？”孟氏狠狠的瞪了一眼余小西，后理直气壮的看向余小荷。余小荷皱了皱眉，没有接话。“没人说二婶婶跟三婶婶你们做的不对，但是我们家的情况大家都是一清二楚的，我们确实是没钱，而并非有钱故意不还给大家，我既然说了会在几个月内还清大家的钱，就一定会做到，还希望二婶婶跟三婶婶回去跟二叔三叔说下，再宽限个几个月，我们又不会跑了。”苏小凡平静的看着孟氏。“……”孟氏两眼微眯，沉默的盯着苏小凡。“好，既然小凡都这样说了，我们大家都再等等吧，乡里乡亲的也都不要太为难了她们，而且大妹子这确实眼看着都要临盆了，家里可不能一点吃食都没有呀。”苏虎笑着看向大伙儿，征求着大家的意见。“好。”“好。”见苏虎如此说了，众人也都点头答应，她们这孤儿寡母的日子本就不好过，大家原本都是清楚的，今日若不是那孟氏李氏来挑唆大家，说她们有钱不还，大家又怎会齐齐的过来为难她们。“那么大家都散了吧。”苏虎领着众人离去，临走前对余小荷说：“你们俩就在这陪陪她们吧。”“好。”余小荷柔柔一笑，目送众人离去。见大家伙都散去了，李氏跟孟氏也都不再多说什么，愤愤的转身带着自家的孩子走了。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 9: Family love is not worth money. Xiao Yimo took it speechlessly, thinking that getting used to it is a terrible thing. After only one day, he was almost used to what she called him, or maybe he was just too lazy to refute her. Mrs. Li took a few steps forward, took a few glances at the basket and said, \"Whose house are you going to steal a chicken from?\" \"You stole a chicken from your sister. Open your eyes and see clearly, it's a pheasant.\" Su Xiaofan couldn't help but cursed angrily. What he hated most in his life was being wronged. \"Why are you talking, kid? I'm just asking.\" Mrs. Li scolded with a dark face. This girl who used to be silent no matter how much she was ridiculed, has she really changed her gender, or is she overstimulated and really crazy? \"Don't Second Aunt know that you can eat randomly, but you can't talk nonsense?\" Su Xiaofan watched Xiao Yimo enter the kitchen and glanced at everyone in the courtyard before saying, \"Our family borrowed your money and we will pay it back as soon as possible. There is no need to worry.\" Ms. Li. After a sneer, he said: \"You yourself said that you can't talk nonsense. How can you repay everyone's money? Aren't you sold to the village chief's house as a child bride?\" Su Xiaofan frowned. Indeed, according to the concept of this place, since the money is collected, forget it. It was sold to the village chief's house: \"Second aunt, you may not know, but I have made an agreement with the village chief to live at home until my mother gives birth to the child and can take care of herself and grandma before going there. In these few months, I will find a way to repay everyone's money.\" \"How many months? You can do it. Earn enough money to pay everyone back? \"What do you do to make money?\" Li asked reluctantly. Although this girl's temperament has changed, she is now a child bride who is illiterate. Even if she wants to be a maid in a wealthy family, no one will accept her. \"I don't need to worry about this for my second aunt. In short, I, Su Xiaofan, will do what I say and will definitely pay you back your money. Don't all the folks in the village be willing to wait for a few months?\" Su Xiaofan smiled and glanced around everyone. \"Well, I'm not in a hurry, but the previous question is, why did you go buy things when you have money instead of returning them to everyone first? Please give us an explanation so that everyone can feel at ease.\" Su Xiaofan looked up and saw that the person who spoke was the third wife Wang - Wang Yin, whose hair was all gone Bai, with a slightly hunched back, was only about sixty years old and almost all his teeth had been lost. Although he did not say it to the outside world, everyone knew that it might have been aborted by Sangong. Sangong had a serious tendency to violence when he was young. Fortunately, now that he is older, his temperament has become much more easy-going. \"Why does our family use it to buy things as soon as we have money? You may not know it here, but they can't know it. That's why I said before about the second aunt and the third aunt. They two noble people forget things a lot.\" \"Fan'er...\" Mrs. Jia tugged on Su Xiaofan's sleeve, trying to tell her to shut up, but at the same time, she also knew that without giving everyone a clear explanation, it would be difficult for everyone to disperse today. \"Mom, don't worry.\" Su Xiaofan gave her a smile, reassuring her that her mother was kind and they had all done that, but her mother was still trying to think of ways to protect their reputations. She, Su Xiaofan, was not an easy talker. Since they didn't care about their relatives, why should he treat them as relatives anymore. Sometimes, in the face of money, the so-called family love is worthless, and she knows this very well. \"If you have something to say, say it openly.\" Meng yelled with confidence in a high-pitched voice. She didn't believe that she, a person who came to collect debts, would be told that she was wrong. It is only natural to pay back debts. \"Everyone must be well aware of the situation in my family. My grandma is old and my mother is about to give birth. The family has no rice to cook for a long time. Recently, my engagement was canceled by the Zhang family and I fell ill again. The Zhang family sent me some silver. In addition to taking medicine and seeing a doctor, I also There was some broken silver left, and grandma used it to buy some cornmeal or something.\" Su Xiaofan paused slightly at this point, and then continued: \"Yesterday, the second and third uncles and their whole family came to collect debts, so they robbed all the things grandma bought yesterday. We have gone, but now there is nothing to eat in the house. The money sent by the village chief's family is not much. We must prepare some food first. As the saying goes, this person is like iron rice or steel. He will be hungry even if he doesn't eat. If our family all starves to death, what should you do? Who can I turn to to pay my debt?\" After hearing this, the third wife walked into the kitchen, looked around, and then came out and said to everyone, \"Young girl Xiaofan is right, there is indeed nothing to eat in this house.\" After hearing this, everyone lowered their heads and whispered. Yu Xiaoxi pointed at Meng angrily and said, \"After all, you are relatives. How can you force someone to do this? It's not like your family is short of food...\" \"Sister, okay.\" Yu Xiaohe stopped her. The second husband Su and the third husband Su were not very good people. People in the village knew it more or less. My sister was still young. If she offended them, she would inevitably be bullied by them in the future. \"What's going on? Is it wrong for me to be the one who borrows money from others?\" Meng glared at Yu Xiaoxi fiercely, and then looked at Yu Xiaohe confidently. Yu Xiaohe frowned and did not answer. \"No one said that Second Aunt and Third Aunt you did something wrong, but the situation of our family is clear to everyone. We do have no money, and we do not have money and deliberately refuse to pay it back to everyone. Since I said I will pay back everyone's money within a few months, I will definitely do it. I also hope that Second Aunt and Third Aunt will go back and tell Second Uncle and Third Uncle that we will not run away after a few more months of grace.\" Su Xiaofan looked at Meng calmly. \"...\" Meng narrowed her eyes slightly and stared at Su Xiaofan silently. \"Okay, since Xiaofan has said this, let's all wait a little longer. Don't make it too difficult for the folks in the village. Besides, the elder sister really sees this.", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}